# Docracy

E-signature monorepo at `apps/worker`, `apps/web`, `apps/connector`, `packages/shared`.

- Cloudflare Workers + KV + R2 + D1 (derived index only) + Resend
- YAGNI: duplicate code except HMAC token logic in `packages/shared`
- D1 never source of truth; anonymous flow has no accounts/DB
- Read `README.md` and `CLAUDE.md` for setup and conventions
- Local dev: `npm run dev:worker` + `npm run dev:web`; tests: `npm test`
- Never commit secrets (`.dev.vars`, `.env`)
